re הַנְּבִיאִים בְּנֵי = members of prophets' guilds 1Kin 20:35 ; 2Kin 2:3 , 5 , 7 , 15 ; 4:1 , 38 (twice in verse); נָבִיא of Genuine prophets (besides phrases), in Judaic prophets, only Jeremiah, Jer 1:5 ; Ezekiel, Ezek 2:5 = 33:33 ; of ancient prophets Jer 28:8-9 , (3 t. in verse); Zech 1:6 ; 8:9 ; especially הראשׁנים הנביאים 1:4 ; 7:7 , 12 , compare עבדי(וׅ הנביאים my ( his ) servants the prophets 2Kin 9:7 ; 17:13 , 23 ; 21:10 ; 24:2 (all R D ) Ezra 9:11 ; Jer 7:25 ; 25:4 ; 26:5 ; 29:19 ; 35:15 ; 44:4 ; Amos 3:7 ; Zech 1:6 , compare Ezek 38:17 ; Dan 9:6 ; הַנּ ׳עבדוֺ his servant the prophet 1Kin 14:18 ; 2Kin 14:25 ; הַנָּבִיא with proper name: Jerome, 2Chr 36:12 ; Dan 9:2 31t. Jeremiah (but ᵐ5 only 4 t., the rest probably redactional, see Gie Jer. xxvii ); Elijah 1Kin 18:36 (om ᵐ5 ), 2Chr 21:12 ; Malachi 3:23; Nathan 2Sam 7:2 10 t. Samuel and Kings; 4 t. Chronicles; Psa 51:2 (title); Isaiah, 2Kin 19:2 ; 20:1 , 14 = Isa 37:2 ; 38:1 ; 39:1 ; 2Kin 20:11 ; 2Chr 26:22 ; 32:20 , 32 ; Habakkuk Hab 1:1 ; 3:1 (titles); Haggai, Hag 1:1 , 3 , 12 ; 2:1 , 10 ; Zechariah, Zech 1:1 , 7 (titles); elsewhere several others in Samuel, Kings and Chronicles 15 t.; נביא is used elsewhere of Genuine prophecy only 1Sam 9:9 34t. Samuel and Kings; 1Chr 16:22 = Psa 105:15 , + 13 t. Chronicles; 74:9 complains of absence of ׳נ ; וְנָבִיא חָזוֺן לַחְתֹּם Dan 9:24 see חתם 2 false prophets: prophets as official class, beside priests, character as false prophets: Isa 28:7 ; Jer 2:26 ; 4:9 ; 6:13 ; 8:1 , 10 ; 13:13 ; 14:18 ; 18:18 ; 23:11 , 33 , 34 ; 26:7-8 , 11 , 16 ; 32:32 ; Zech 7:3 , app. also 2Kin 23:2 ; Neh 9:32 ; Lam 2:20 ; Jer 29:1 ; Ezek 7:26 (in these not characterized); always false (except of ancient and special prophets given above) in Amos 7:14 ; Hosea 4:5 ; 9:7-8 , Micah 3:5-6 , 11 ; Isa 3:2 ; 9:14 ; 29:10 ; Jer 2:8 , 30 ; 5:13 , 31 ; 14:13-14 , 15 (twice in verse); 23:9 16 t. 27:9 , 14 , 15 , 16 , 18 ; 29:8 , 15 ; 37:19 ; Ezek 13:2 (twice in verse); 13:3-4 , 9 , 16 ; 14:4 , 7 , 9 (twice in verse); 14:10 ; 22:25 , 28 ; Zeph 3:4 ; Lam 2:9 , 14 ; 4:13 ; especially discredited Deut 13:2 ; 13:4 ; 13:6 ; 18:20 (twice in verse); 18:22 (twice in verse); Zech 13:2 , 4 , 5 ; such a prophet Hananiah called הַנָּבִיא Jer 28:1 , 5 , 10 , 12 , 15 , 17 ( ᵐ5 omits in all but 28:1 , where ψευδοπροφήτης ). Usage of prophets themselves gives such a bad flavour to נביא , that we are not surprised that it is absent from exilic Isaiah, the Wisdom Literature, and Psalms (except for special reasons in 3 Psalms given under 1 ). 3 heathen prophets 1Kin 18:20 ; 19:1 ; 2Kin 3:13 (twice in verse); האשׁדה נביאי 1Kin 18:19 ; הבעל נביאי 18:19 , 22 , 25 , 40 ; 2Kin 10:19 ; 1Kin 22:6 , 10 , 12 , 13 , 22 , 23 2Chr 18:5 ; 18:9 ; 18:11 ; 18:12 ; 18:21 ; 18:22 .","rootNote":"from 5012 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 16 22","keyReferences":["1Chr 16 22","1Chr 17 1","1Chr 25 1","1Chr 29 29","1Kgs 1 8","1Kgs 1 10","1Kgs 1 22","1Kgs 1 23"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":317,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 16 22","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/בִ/נְבִיאַ֖/י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncmpc/Sp1cs"},{"reference":"1Chr 17 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":17,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/נָּבִ֗יא","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 25 1","book":"1Chr","chapter":25,"verse":1,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"ה/נביאים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 29 29","book":"1Chr","chapter":29,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/נָּבִ֔יא","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 8","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/נָּבִיא֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Kgs 1 10","book":"1Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/נָּבִ֨יא","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"refere